# Step 28, sections 6 and 7 of the system prompt: the index of skills and
# tool sources, the extensions' own text, their caps, and the epoch rule
# with the notices of the source `extensions`
# (`crates/cineris-agent/src/context/{prompt.rs,extensions.rs}`, the loop's
# `turn/epochs.rs`). Each rule broken on its own, with the tests that must
# fail. Written with the code (docs/steps/28/answered.md, point 7).

